  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'SKYFIRE GRAND PRIX

    Your actual customized NWH tractor rides an animated
    dragon through every ordered gate. Clear the configured laps; actual crossings
    and elapsed time determine results. Inferno trades speed for stamina, while Fire
    trades endurance for speed and turning.

    Keyboard directional keys: turn
    and climb/descend. Tap your action to breathe fire; hold it to sprint. Hold forward+back
    together for the limited air brake; hold left+right together for a controlled
    dive. Whole-pad: left stick turns/climbs, RT accelerates/sprints, LT brakes,
    EAST dives, SOUTH attacks. Shared-stick crews use their own stick and trigger;
    stick click brakes.

    Strong actual collisions or repeated animated hits can
    dislodge the real truck. Action deploys its physical emergency parachute; the
    dragon visibly approaches and may grab it at an actual animation contact. A claw
    carry and visible return to the saddle adds4seconds. After a genuinely failed
    rescue, an announced last-checkpoint recovery adds12seconds; three failures retire
    that crew. No timer awards a finish.

    One to four local human crews, with
    AI using the same flight, stamina, attack and gate rules. Pause/reconnect preserves
    the match; rematch resets it. Miles per hour and feet are shown. Offline local
    play.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
